      "source": "Resolves <a href=\"../../../../../../http/HttpEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpEntity</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../../../../http/RequestEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>RequestEntity</code></a> method argument values,\nas well as return values of type <a href=\"../../../../../../http/HttpEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpEntity</code></a>, <a href=\"../../../../../../http/ResponseEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ResponseEntity</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../../../../../ErrorResponse.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web\"><code>ErrorResponse</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../../../../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a>.",
